[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Flashbacks-720p,Impress BT,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Captions,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,60,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1.5,0,1,3.8,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 5,0:00:10.23,0:00:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On your guard, everyone!Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.53,0:00:13.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We let those pirates in with all of us on guard,Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and it'll be an embarrassment to Galley-La!Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them in!Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about the back door?Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.05,0:00:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back door? We're surrounding the entire building!Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.61,0:00:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got no blind spots!Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.88,0:00:29.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come get some! We'll take on your whole crew!Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.80,0:00:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.23,0:00:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're all armed and tough looking.Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.14,0:00:41.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No surprise there. The shipwrights here beat even pirates.Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.39,0:00:45.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should be careful and act when the time is right.Dialogue: 5,0:00:45.49,0:00:50.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if we mess this up, we'll be in big trouble.Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.43,0:01:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking! He suddenly barged in there this afternoon.Dialogue: 5,0:01:00.00,0:01:05.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, we don't know what'll happen.  Don't miss even the slightest movement.Dialogue: 5,0:01:05.57,0:01:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 5,0:01:07.66,0:01:09.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us know immediately if anyone moves.Dialogue: 5,0:01:09.83,0:01:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep. Got it.Dialogue: 5,0:01:11.70,0:01:14.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll be a long night,  but don't let your guard down.Dialogue: 5,0:01:14.60,0:01:17.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we miss our chance tonight,Dialogue: 5,0:01:17.20,0:01:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll be left with no idea of what happened.Dialogue: 5,0:01:20.51,0:01:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just assume this is our last chance to go after Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:01:24.02,0:01:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now's the time for us to step up.Dialogue: 5,0:01:26.65,0:01:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll get Robin back no matter what.Dialogue: 5,0:03:30.97,0:03:32.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa...Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.31,0:03:38.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but could you step outside for a moment?Dialogue: 5,0:03:39.16,0:03:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.50,0:03:42.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also...Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.59,0:03:45.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,please send Paulie in here.Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.24,0:03:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie...Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.11,0:03:52.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:03:52.13,0:03:54.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san has something important to tell you.Dialogue: 5,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me?Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.65,0:03:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, just you.Dialogue: 5,0:03:58.43,0:04:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be in my office. Just call me if anything happens.Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.85,0:04:04.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 5,0:04:06.24,0:04:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Taking pains to have a tete-a-tete at a time like this...Dialogue: 5,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the devil could it be about?Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.61,0:04:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beats me.Dialogue: 5,0:04:13.30,0:04:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His last words?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.08,0:04:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She said it was important. Get in there and talk to him already.Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.55,0:04:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...Dialogue: 5,0:04:22.81,0:04:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall we step away from the door for a bit?Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.70,0:04:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.30,0:04:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he needs  to talk to Paulie about!Dialogue: 5,0:04:35.60,0:04:39.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Iceburg-san we're talking about.  It must be very important.Dialogue: 5,0:04:39.41,0:04:42.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More importantly, we've got to deal with these pirates.Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.20,0:04:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:04:43.50,0:04:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,According to Kalifa's investigation,  there are seven of them.Dialogue: 5,0:04:47.99,0:04:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The captain, Straw Hat Luffy.  Pirate Hunter Zoro and Nico Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.70,0:04:55.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's also the girl who came  to Dock One this afternoonDialogue: 5,0:04:55.95,0:04:57.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the lad with the rounded long nose.Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.25,0:05:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. There were two others, and that was it.Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.60,0:05:06.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their goal is of no concern to us.Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.24,0:05:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coming in here will be the last thing they ever do.Dialogue: 5,0:05:10.10,0:05:14.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll put the whole crew down once and for all.Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.57,0:05:21.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, understood.Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.76,0:05:25.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This could be very risky.Dialogue: 5,0:05:25.29,0:05:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been racking my brain, but you're the only one I can trust.Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.19,0:05:30.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will you do it for me?Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.10,0:05:34.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're acting like I'm a stranger.  Please leave it to me.Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.98,0:05:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll get on it immediately.Dialogue: 5,0:05:41.89,0:05:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please do.Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.97,0:05:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finished talking?Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.89,0:05:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:05:52.60,0:05:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something came up. Sorry,  but I have to leave for a bit. Cool?Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.51,0:06:01.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's fine. The four of us  will be more than enough.Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.61,0:06:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.10,0:06:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch over Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:06:16.91,0:06:18.57,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Listen, Paulie.Dialogue: 5,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.53,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,Right under the desk in my office,Dialogue: 5,0:06:21.53,0:06:24.20,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,lift up the carpet to find...Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.81,0:06:26.61,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,a safe buried there.Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.31,0:06:28.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This must be it.Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.62,0:06:34.91,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the combination,  so listen carefully.Dialogue: 5,0:06:34.91,0:06:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, right... six...Dialogue: 5,0:06:45.09,0:06:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.69,0:06:48.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.51,0:06:50.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're ready.Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.60,0:06:53.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'll cause a disturbance.Dialogue: 5,0:06:53.00,0:06:57.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The four of you will execute your assignments after the signal.Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.40,0:06:58.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 5,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready, Nico Robin?Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.27,0:07:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, anytime.Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An explosion!Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.25,0:07:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that explosion?!Dialogue: 5,0:07:19.59,0:07:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring water, now!Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.85,0:07:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take the injured someplace safe!Dialogue: 5,0:07:23.05,0:07:25.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Put out the fire!Dialogue: 5,0:07:25.59,0:07:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Was it cannon fire?Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.01,0:07:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it didn't fly in!Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.90,0:07:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone set it to explode!Dialogue: 5,0:07:32.55,0:07:34.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!  Hurry up and put out the fire!Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.99,0:07:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone, give me a hand!Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was one hell of a signal.Dialogue: 5,0:07:42.46,0:07:43.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.23,0:07:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The explosion was at the first floor's north corner.Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.71,0:07:52.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?!Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.85,0:07:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Half of you stay at your post!  We still haven't seen the enemy!Dialogue: 5,0:07:57.68,0:08:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fortify the perimeter and prepare for an attack!Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.35,0:08:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them in the building!Dialogue: 5,0:08:06.12,0:08:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Iceburg-san ?!Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was a surprise.Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.73,0:08:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw someone in the shadows!Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.69,0:08:14.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's wearing a costume! Catch her!Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.51,0:08:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here they come!Dialogue: 5,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave 'em to me!Dialogue: 5,0:08:19.40,0:08:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll get 'em!Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!Dialogue: 5,0:08:22.90,0:08:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good heavens...Dialogue: 5,0:08:29.78,0:08:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This way! Catch her!Dialogue: 5,0:08:32.10,0:08:33.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away!Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.41,0:08:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's all alone! Corner her!Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, pirate assassin!Dialogue: 5,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She went upstairs using a whip!Dialogue: 5,0:09:04.57,0:09:07.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You thought there'd be no one on the roof?Dialogue: 5,0:09:08.32,0:09:11.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate Galley-La's craftsmen.Dialogue: 5,0:09:11.50,0:09:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock us  by attempting an assassination?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.66,0:09:17.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, pirate!Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're definitely not  gonna forgive you bastards!Dialogue: 5,0:09:21.55,0:09:25.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't try anything.  You're no match for me.Dialogue: 5,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're two here!Dialogue: 5,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're headed to the back door!Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.57,0:09:35.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't lose them! Close off their escape!Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.58,0:09:37.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep them out of the building!Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move! Take them down now!Dialogue: 5,0:09:45.50,0:09:49.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You memorized his residence's layout, right, Nico Robin?Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.02,0:09:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The craftsmen are in a panic.Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.87,0:10:00.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's gettin' pretty rowdy.Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.91,0:10:06.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do? We should probably get in there.Dialogue: 5,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Where's Luffy?Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.38,0:10:11.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaat?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.14,0:10:20.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think before you act! Dumbass captain!Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.52,0:10:22.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too late for that...Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.51,0:10:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The back door! They're headed  to the back door! Corner them!Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.50,0:10:28.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away! Surround them!Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.97,0:10:39.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got a death wish, showing your faces here in front of all us guards?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.54,0:10:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make light of the Galley-La craftsmen!Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.07,0:10:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your fate was sealed the moment you laid a hand on Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:10:46.75,0:10:47.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just give up!Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ain't goin' nowhere, pirates!Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give up and show your faces!Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.41,0:11:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two will be bait for the rest of your crew, damn assassins!Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.84,0:11:11.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna do something!Dialogue: 5,0:11:11.19,0:11:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot them!Dialogue: 5,0:11:31.51,0:11:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They disappeared... No way!Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.64,0:11:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.96,0:11:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.65,0:11:46.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.54,0:11:51.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's strong... What's with that whip user?Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She ran... through the air.Dialogue: 5,0:11:54.41,0:11:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way...Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.22,0:11:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ran through the air?Dialogue: 5,0:11:59.60,0:12:03.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you people never listen, do you?Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.05,0:12:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She jumped off!Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.14,0:12:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.51,0:12:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There she goes again! She double-jumped in midair!Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.18,0:12:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Briar Road!Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.08,0:12:33.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you not to do that.Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.92,0:12:35.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! She's coming!Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.43,0:12:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She landed in the courtyard!  Circle around behind her!Dialogue: 5,0:12:38.71,0:12:41.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Over there! Get ahead of her and cut her off!Dialogue: 5,0:12:41.43,0:12:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 5,0:12:46.06,0:12:47.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This must be it.Dialogue: 5,0:12:48.64,0:12:49.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa,Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.58,0:12:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so that's what Mr. Iceburg's been hiding, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:12:55.46,0:12:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it here.Dialogue: 5,0:13:00.47,0:13:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know what it's worth.Dialogue: 5,0:13:06.34,0:13:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you bastards?Dialogue: 5,0:13:08.31,0:13:10.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from?Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.28,0:13:12.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The darkness.Dialogue: 5,0:13:12.62,0:13:17.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, we are simply administering justice.Dialogue: 5,0:13:17.51,0:13:21.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are Cipher Pol No. 9,  a covert intelligence agency.Dialogue: 5,0:13:23.50,0:13:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wherever you came from,Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.71,0:13:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you must've encountered our craftsmen.Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.10,0:13:30.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did we?Dialogue: 5,0:13:31.64,0:13:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We might have... or we might not have...Dialogue: 5,0:13:36.74,0:13:40.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't really remember the details.Dialogue: 5,0:13:42.07,0:13:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no longer a simple assassination, is it?Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.51,0:13:50.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't recall us calling it that.Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.58,0:13:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, hand over Mr. Iceburg's valuable documents,Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.48,0:13:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and... since you've learned  something about it...Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.57,0:14:03.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you must die.Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.26,0:14:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the name of justice...Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.99,0:14:10.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right here... right now...Dialogue: 5,0:14:13.03,0:14:15.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you find the two  who vanished near the back door?!Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.06,0:14:18.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! We can't find them anywhere!Dialogue: 5,0:14:18.52,0:14:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about inside the residence?!Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're guards at every window and door!Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.55,0:14:23.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way they'd get in!Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.24,0:14:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn pirates! Where'd they go?!Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.12,0:14:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've gotta be lurking nearby!Dialogue: 5,0:14:29.15,0:14:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep looking! We've got to find them! Got that?!Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.05,0:14:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's behind this wall.Dialogue: 5,0:14:41.61,0:14:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. Now, push me.Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.84,0:14:53.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You startled me.Dialogue: 5,0:14:53.71,0:14:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come sooner or later...Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.79,0:14:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I never thought  you'd come through there.Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.00,0:15:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you do the same last night?Dialogue: 5,0:15:01.46,0:15:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know there isn't any door there.Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.65,0:15:05.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the power of the Door-Door Fruit.Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.60,0:15:09.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard a wall is,  the area I touch becomes a door.Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.93,0:15:13.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as there's a wall,  I can come and go as I please.Dialogue: 5,0:15:17.58,0:15:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?! We haven't got the signal yet.Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.85,0:15:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't call someone weakened  when he's got the energy to talk.Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.25,0:15:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like a good chef wouldn't neglect  to prepare the ingredients beforehand,Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.78,0:15:34.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,pros would be careful to restrain their victimDialogue: 5,0:15:34.75,0:15:39.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and prevent anything unexpected before the appointed time.Dialogue: 5,0:15:39.61,0:15:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's... CP9's way of doing things, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.39,0:15:50.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've read the situation well. You're exactly right.Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.54,0:15:58.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wronged Straw Hat...Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.61,0:16:01.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, as I suspected,  he had nothing to do with this.Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.53,0:16:06.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to feel bad.Dialogue: 5,0:16:06.00,0:16:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just told the truth  that you saw me last night.Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.46,0:16:17.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was also part of your plan?Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.25,0:16:18.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.69,0:16:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We kept you alive to pin the blame on the pirates.Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.50,0:16:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, if we suddenly killed you,Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.98,0:16:29.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't know where to find what we're after,Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.55,0:16:34.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the blueprints of a certain ship.Dialogue: 5,0:16:34.29,0:16:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's something that  has been secretly passed downDialogue: 5,0:16:37.02,0:16:41.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from shipwright to apprentice shipwright for generations.Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.31,0:16:44.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you felt your life was in danger,Dialogue: 5,0:16:44.71,0:16:48.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'd try to entrust it with someone for sure.Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.02,0:16:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the one you chose was Paulie,  one of the Dock One foremen.Dialogue: 5,0:16:54.75,0:16:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our agents are with him right now.Dialogue: 5,0:16:58.71,0:17:04.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So everything is going... as you planned, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:17:05.66,0:17:08.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ensure that everything remains flawless to the end.Dialogue: 5,0:17:08.10,0:17:08.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.56,0:17:12.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with the shipwrights outside.Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.54,0:17:18.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, finish him off.Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.60,0:17:22.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once those two get the blueprints from Paulie, they'll contact you.Dialogue: 5,0:17:25.36,0:17:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill Iceburg at that moment.Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.70,0:17:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our mission is accomplished  once we kill Paulie,Dialogue: 5,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who's come to know the truth.Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.80,0:17:39.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that, the Straw Hats will shoulder all the blame.Dialogue: 5,0:17:44.42,0:17:49.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, why can't he just listen  to people's advice?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:49.96,0:17:51.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's always the same.Dialogue: 5,0:17:51.75,0:17:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But... Robin might be somewhere in that commotion, right?Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.68,0:18:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?! We have to be careful!Dialogue: 5,0:18:00.49,0:18:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Depending on how you look at it,  we've lucked out.Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.19,0:18:07.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When Luffy marches into enemy territory,Dialogue: 5,0:18:07.60,0:18:10.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,do you think he'd go around  to the back or the side?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.76,0:18:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.75,0:18:13.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No chance.Dialogue: 5,0:18:13.11,0:18:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet by now he's jumped or run headfirst into the residence,Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,happy to have found a way in,Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.80,0:18:22.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,running around aimlessly with no idea where to go. Sound about right?Dialogue: 5,0:18:22.76,0:18:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure does.Dialogue: 5,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.13,0:18:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right? From the shipwrights' perspective,Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.01,0:18:30.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy is the ringleader of a criminal gang.Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.70,0:18:34.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once the main event jumps in, everyone's attention is bound to be on him!Dialogue: 5,0:18:34.90,0:18:37.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's safe to assumeDialogue: 5,0:18:37.11,0:18:39.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that the residence's front guard is pretty thin right now!Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.38,0:18:42.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we'll take advantage of thatDialogue: 5,0:18:42.14,0:18:45.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and slip into the crowd of rampaging shipwrights!Dialogue: 5,0:18:45.42,0:18:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. So thanks to Luffy,  right now's our best chance to get in, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:18:50.57,0:18:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm convinced! So, it should be okay to jump in, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.00,0:18:55.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can jump over that wall!Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.61,0:18:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you guys ready?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:58.47,0:18:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're goin' in!Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.54,0:19:00.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.01,0:19:17.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is this "pretty thin"?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:18.57,0:19:21.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I'm stuck!Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.64,0:19:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted to jump into the building,  all fast and furious,Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.20,0:19:28.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I'm trapped!Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.90,0:19:32.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped!Dialogue: 5,0:19:33.05,0:19:35.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry...Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.35,0:19:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just wait, Robin!Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.89,0:19:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.82,0:20:04.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone! Third floor!Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.21,0:20:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to the hall to the president's bedroom!Dialogue: 5,0:20:06.47,0:20:09.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The guards were wiped out!  Someone! Come upstairs!Dialogue: 5,0:20:10.19,0:20:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.79,0:20:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tilestone-san !Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.71,0:20:16.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku and Lucci should be there!Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.21,0:20:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they're...Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.40,0:20:18.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.83,0:20:31.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku! Lucci!Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.34,0:20:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good grief, there's no end in sight.  No word yet?Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.72,0:20:38.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 5,0:20:39.61,0:20:42.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.84,0:20:44.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a noisy man.Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.77,0:20:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san better be okay!Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.29,0:20:51.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check on him yourself.Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.40,0:20:53.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.00,0:21:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His giant hammer!Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.80,0:21:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-No way!Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.54,0:21:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You son of a...Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.36,0:21:15.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go, you bastard!Dialogue: 5,0:21:15.22,0:21:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you pride yourself in your brute strength?Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.88,0:21:22.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't move my arm! There's no way I can lose a contest of strength!Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.55,0:21:43.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three of the foremen!Dialogue: 5,0:21:49.22,0:21:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Call for reinforcements from downstairs!Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.89,0:21:51.91,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 5,0:21:57.75,0:21:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We found them!Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.72,0:22:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Roronoa Zoro!Dialogue: 5,0:22:00.13,0:22:01.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They finally showed up!Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.96,0:22:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.69,0:22:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw her this afternoon too!Dialogue: 5,0:22:05.05,0:22:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After them!Dialogue: 5,0:22:06.37,0:22:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Why isn't Luffy here?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:08.92,0:22:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How should I know?!  I'd love to find out!Dialogue: 5,0:22:12.97,0:22:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:14.29,0:22:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Given how it's turned out, we're pretty much caught red-handed.Dialogue: 5,0:22:18.21,0:22:20.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know one way to get through.Dialogue: 5,0:22:22.40,0:22:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Zoro! What're you gonna do?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:24.80,0:22:27.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Running around the building  won't get us anywhere.Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.85,0:22:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We storm in through the front and find Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:22:31.58,0:22:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:32.97,0:22:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they're shipwrights!  They're not our enemy, you know!Dialogue: 5,0:22:36.56,0:22:39.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll use the back of the blades!Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.51,0:22:44.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Out of our way!Dialogue: 5,0:22:48.97,0:22:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you're inflicting fatal wounds on them!Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.86,0:23:13.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, this is a surprise.Dialogue: 5,0:23:13.63,0:23:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I never thought  I'd see you here... Nico Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:23:19.60,0:23:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have we met before?Dialogue: 5,0:23:21.70,0:23:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We met for the first time last night.Dialogue: 5,0:23:24.19,0:23:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I've wanted to meet you for a long time.Dialogue: 5,0:23:30.01,0:23:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I even put your wanted poster up in my room  to ensure I never forgot.Dialogue: 5,0:23:34.29,0:23:35.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you like an autograph?Dialogue: 5,0:23:37.71,0:23:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I'm... good!Dialogue: 5,0:23:42.52,0:23:43.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you wanted to kill me?Dialogue: 5,0:23:44.48,0:23:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.91,0:23:47.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before you destroy the world!Dialogue: 5,0:23:49.68,0:23:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you searching  for the poneglyphs?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:53.37,0:23:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since ancient times,Dialogue: 5,0:23:55.29,0:23:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the government has universally declared it a felonyDialogue: 5,0:23:58.48,0:24:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to seek out and decipher the poneglyphs.Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.90,0:24:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know that much.Dialogue: 5,0:24:04.57,0:24:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, too, know of the existence of the poneglyphs.Dialogue: 5,0:24:07.64,0:24:10.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just knowing about it wouldn't be a crime.Dialogue: 5,0:24:10.26,0:24:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the only one in the whole world  who can decipher those texts...Dialogue: 5,0:24:15.27,0:24:16.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is you.Dialogue: 5,0:24:18.10,0:24:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why the government put  such a huge bounty on your head,Dialogue: 5,0:24:22.56,0:24:25.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even though you were only eight years old.Dialogue: 5,0:24:25.51,0:24:28.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's because you're the only one in the worldDialogue: 5,0:24:28.20,0:24:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who can restore the ancient weapon!Dialogue: 5,0:24:34.33,0:24:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. You know about the weapon.Dialogue: 5,0:24:39.56,0:24:41.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All things considered,Dialogue: 5,0:24:41.59,0:24:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never thought CP9 actually existed as an organization.Dialogue: 5,0:24:44.84,0:24:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it does, it means that you've  already left the Straw Hat PiratesDialogue: 5,0:24:48.41,0:24:50.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and have been helping the government.Dialogue: 5,0:24:50.84,0:24:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's bizarre for a woman who's been on the run for 20 years to act like that,Dialogue: 5,0:24:54.65,0:24:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but, well, that is not my concern.Dialogue: 5,0:24:59.04,0:25:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If deciphering the poneglyphs leads to the weapon's return,Dialogue: 5,0:25:02.11,0:25:05.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the outcome will be the sameDialogue: 5,0:25:05.02,0:25:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,no matter how just or evil its owner.Dialogue: 5,0:25:08.39,0:25:12.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weapon can never bring  forth peace to this world.Dialogue: 5,0:25:12.66,0:25:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It will bring the end of the world.Dialogue: 5,0:25:16.37,0:25:20.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We mustn't call forth a relic of the past!Dialogue: 5,0:25:23.42,0:25:26.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right. I agree with you.Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.45,0:25:31.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's none of your business.  Whatever I do to research history,Dialogue: 5,0:25:31.80,0:25:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a stranger like you has no right to lecture me.Dialogue: 5,0:25:37.28,0:25:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well... not quite...Dialogue: 5,0:25:40.31,0:25:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since you and I are  in the same boat, in a sense.Dialogue: 5,0:25:45.19,0:25:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 5,0:25:47.41,0:25:50.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have the blueprints  of the ancient weapon Pluton.Dialogue: 5,0:25:51.57,0:25:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weapon's blueprints?!Dialogue: 5,0:25:53.64,0:25:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pluton is the name of a battleship  built on this island a long time ago.Dialogue: 5,0:26:00.41,0:26:05.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ancient engineer who created such a powerful weaponDialogue: 5,0:26:05.31,0:26:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,thought that, if Pluton were to get out of control,Dialogue: 5,0:26:08.81,0:26:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a counterforce would be needed to stop it.Dialogue: 5,0:26:11.33,0:26:15.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, he handed down the blueprints to future generations.Dialogue: 5,0:26:15.04,0:26:16.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government...Dialogue: 5,0:26:16.56,0:26:20.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has finally resorted to using force to acquire these blueprints.Dialogue: 5,0:26:22.29,0:26:25.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imagine helping them without knowing the history.Dialogue: 5,0:26:25.81,0:26:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm too shocked to speak.Dialogue: 5,0:26:28.36,0:26:31.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The man who entrusted the blueprints to me was named Tom.Dialogue: 5,0:26:31.45,0:26:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He had been concerned about a girlDialogue: 5,0:26:33.89,0:26:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who was the sole survivor of the Ohara incident 20 years ago.Dialogue: 5,0:26:37.56,0:26:39.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said that although she was small,Dialogue: 5,0:26:39.61,0:26:43.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she was dangerous since she had  the same ideology as those Oharan devils.Dialogue: 5,0:26:43.37,0:26:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I inherited the creator's will,  so I am responsible for stopping you!Dialogue: 5,0:26:48.51,0:26:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that the government is aware of the blueprints' existence,Dialogue: 5,0:26:52.18,0:26:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it would be better to just let them burn.Dialogue: 5,0:26:55.36,0:26:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I can't do that because you're alive,Dialogue: 5,0:26:58.01,0:27:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,leaving a possibility of the weapon's return!Dialogue: 5,0:27:14.50,0:27:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that all you want to say before you die?Dialogue: 5,0:27:18.57,0:27:24.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, even if you killed me  and stopped its return,Dialogue: 5,0:27:24.20,0:27:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,wouldn't allowing the blueprints to get stolen amount to the same thing?Dialogue: 5,0:27:34.26,0:27:35.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um...Dialogue: 5,0:27:36.53,0:27:39.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,let me tell you one more thing.Dialogue: 5,0:27:41.78,0:27:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who fell for my ruse.Dialogue: 5,0:27:55.85,0:27:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's it!Dialogue: 5,0:28:05.91,0:28:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I finally got out! That was terrible.Dialogue: 5,0:28:09.05,0:28:11.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm goin' in this time for sure.Dialogue: 5,0:28:11.58,0:28:13.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get Robin!Dialogue: 5,0:28:13.73,0:28:17.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 5,0:28:17.27,0:28:21.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocket!Dialogue: 5,0:28:37.59,0:28:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're no match for our techniques.Dialogue: 5,0:28:43.70,0:28:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, hand it over already...Dialogue: 5,0:28:47.43,0:28:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or else it'll get stained with your blood.Dialogue: 5,0:28:52.15,0:28:53.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 5,0:28:54.63,0:28:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought... I could defeat you.Dialogue: 5,0:29:07.50,0:29:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth...Dialogue: 5,0:29:10.07,0:29:14.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san told me to just run away.Dialogue: 5,0:29:15.02,0:29:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He told me to drop it and run...Dialogue: 5,0:29:24.17,0:29:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since...Dialogue: 5,0:29:26.70,0:29:29.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's a complete fake.Dialogue: 5,0:29:30.30,0:29:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:29:31.97,0:29:33.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fake, you said?Dialogue: 5,0:29:33.45,0:29:35.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How foolish...Dialogue: 5,0:29:36.72,0:29:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are,  but this means your plan failed, doesn't it?Dialogue: 5,0:29:41.14,0:29:44.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How pathetic. Sorry, pal.Dialogue: 5,0:29:44.50,0:29:50.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what you're looking for.Dialogue: 5,0:29:50.85,0:29:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How cocky...  You think that you outwitted CP9?Dialogue: 5,0:29:58.11,0:30:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, you may only be a decoy,Dialogue: 5,0:30:00.07,0:30:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we can't let you live now that you're involved.Dialogue: 5,0:30:17.95,0:30:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck! Dammit! I'm stuck again!Dialogue: 5,0:30:22.55,0:30:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why does this always happen?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:24.18,0:30:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 5,0:30:25.47,0:30:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:30:26.71,0:30:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! The rope guy!Dialogue: 5,0:30:28.55,0:30:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to you? Are you okay?Dialogue: 5,0:30:31.51,0:30:35.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're covered in blood.  You sure are full of surprises!Dialogue: 5,0:30:35.04,0:30:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should say the same about you! This is the third floor!Dialogue: 5,0:30:39.48,0:30:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy...Dialogue: 5,0:30:41.15,0:30:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you come all this way to take the blame?Dialogue: 5,0:30:45.44,0:30:48.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Masks! Are they masks?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:48.15,0:30:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then you people must be  the ones who're making Robin do stuff!Dialogue: 5,0:30:51.33,0:30:53.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give Robin back to us, you damn bastards!Dialogue: 5,0:30:54.23,0:30:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Hey! Say something!Dialogue: 5,0:30:57.05,0:30:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick.Dialogue: 5,0:31:06.45,0:31:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 5,0:31:12.36,0:31:13.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His kick took out the wall!Dialogue: 5,0:31:16.02,0:31:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 5,0:31:29.44,0:31:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are these?Dialogue: 5,0:31:32.25,0:31:34.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got an emergency situation.Dialogue: 5,0:31:34.35,0:31:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for you.Dialogue: 5,0:31:36.33,0:31:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't move!Dialogue: 5,0:31:37.55,0:31:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, restrain that guy, too.  We don't have time to fight them.Dialogue: 5,0:31:40.65,0:31:41.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right...Dialogue: 5,0:31:57.87,0:32:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's me. The operation has been compromised.Dialogue: 5,0:32:01.35,0:32:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come to the bedroom immediately.Dialogue: 5,0:32:03.75,0:32:05.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot Iceburg yet.Dialogue: 5,0:32:06.44,0:32:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got that? Do not shoot Iceburg yet.Dialogue: 5,0:32:13.95,0:32:16.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish I had more time for you,Dialogue: 5,0:32:17.73,0:32:20.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but something came up. So, excuse me.Dialogue: 5,0:32:20.14,0:32:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you trying to run?!Dialogue: 5,0:32:22.08,0:32:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 5,0:32:30.20,0:32:32.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have other business, so we're done here.Dialogue: 5,0:32:32.70,0:32:34.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! Lulu-san !Dialogue: 5,0:32:34.39,0:32:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With a single blow?!Dialogue: 5,0:32:35.13,0:32:36.02,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it!Dialogue: 5,0:32:39.39,0:32:40.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There she goes again!Dialogue: 5,0:32:42.33,0:32:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you... okay?Dialogue: 5,0:32:46.76,0:32:49.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is... nothing!Dialogue: 5,0:32:49.40,0:32:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. Straw Hat, why did you come here?Dialogue: 5,0:32:54.90,0:32:57.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks that you guys are to blame.Dialogue: 5,0:32:57.75,0:33:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It was all  because of our prejudices.Dialogue: 5,0:33:01.71,0:33:05.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.  We're used to being hunted.Dialogue: 5,0:33:05.73,0:33:09.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More importantly, a member of our crew  was taken by masked men.Dialogue: 5,0:33:09.96,0:33:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I came to take her back.Dialogue: 5,0:33:13.34,0:33:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, right?Dialogue: 5,0:33:19.86,0:33:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You seem like a strong fighter.Dialogue: 5,0:33:22.23,0:33:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am!Dialogue: 5,0:33:24.42,0:33:25.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you beat them?Dialogue: 5,0:33:26.30,0:33:27.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can!Dialogue: 5,0:33:29.82,0:33:33.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, fight with me! I wanna beat them, too!Dialogue: 5,0:33:33.10,0:33:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You do...Dialogue: 5,0:33:33.70,0:33:34.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course I do!Dialogue: 5,0:33:34.91,0:33:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why... Why does Iceburg-san have to die at the hands of some random idiots?!Dialogue: 5,0:33:40.66,0:33:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!  Who the hell are those people?!Dialogue: 5,0:33:43.85,0:33:46.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To hell with these secret agent bastards!Dialogue: 5,0:33:48.88,0:33:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That man... He's my mentor.Dialogue: 5,0:33:53.89,0:33:56.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He helped me become a master shipwright!Dialogue: 5,0:33:56.31,0:33:58.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do this to someone like him?!Dialogue: 5,0:33:58.14,0:34:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in no shape to...Dialogue: 5,0:34:00.24,0:34:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said I want to beat  the crap out of those idiots!Dialogue: 5,0:34:03.49,0:34:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares what happens  to my body after that?!Dialogue: 5,0:34:09.14,0:34:11.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll fight till I'm nothing but bones!Dialogue: 5,0:34:11.95,0:34:14.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Take these off!Dialogue: 5,0:34:14.85,0:34:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! Take them off! Dammit!Dialogue: 5,0:34:42.44,0:34:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go home!Dialogue: 5,0:34:45.35,0:34:47.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to give you!Dialogue: 5,0:34:48.11,0:34:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That puts us in quite a bind.Dialogue: 5,0:34:57.08,0:35:00.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where should I begin...Dialogue: 5,0:35:03.13,0:35:04.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as you face your death?Dialogue: 5,0:35:05.54,0:35:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You disappointed me.Dialogue: 5,0:35:12.60,0:35:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci!Dialogue: 5,0:35:14.30,0:35:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault.Dialogue: 5,0:35:19.39,0:35:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should've given them to the government  when they asked nicely.Dialogue: 5,0:35:24.44,0:35:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku!Dialogue: 5,0:35:26.59,0:35:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish my memories of this city could have been free of hurting you.Dialogue: 5,0:35:33.39,0:35:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa...Dialogue: 5,0:35:35.15,0:35:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you also inherited your  master's obstinacy, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:35:38.05,0:35:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno, from the bar...Dialogue: 5,0:35:41.01,0:35:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys... work for... the government?Dialogue: 5,0:35:46.37,0:35:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. Going undercoverDialogue: 5,0:35:49.10,0:35:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was a pretty easy mission for us.Dialogue: 5,0:35:52.56,0:35:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must say, your cunning leaves me at a loss for words.Dialogue: 5,0:35:59.23,0:36:01.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, Iceburg-san...Dialogue: 5,0:36:02.07,0:36:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are the blueprints  for the ancient weapon Pluton?Dialogue: 5,0:36:07.00,0:36:11.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please tell us before you sacrifice many more lives.Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.50,0:35:52.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,The World Government's Covert Intelligence Service Cipher Pol No. 9Dialogue: 1,0:35:47.50,0:35:52.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,The World Government's Covert Intelligence Service Cipher Pol No. 9Dialogue: 2,0:35:47.50,0:35:52.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,The World Government's Covert Intelligence Service Cipher Pol No. 9Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:02:03.45,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:01:57.89,0:02:03.45,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:01:57.89,0:02:03.45,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:02:03.45,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.89,0:02:03.45,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:08.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:02:04.16,0:02:08.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:02:04.16,0:02:08.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:08.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:02:04.16,0:02:08.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:12.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:02:08.73,0:02:12.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 2,0:02:08.73,0:02:12.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:02:08.73,0:02:12.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:02:08.73,0:02:12.61,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:18.74,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:02:14.11,0:02:18.74,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 2,0:02:14.11,0:02:18.74,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:18.74,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack ZenefDialogue: 1,0:02:14.